sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent
    participant R as Recommendation
    participant AP as Approval Gate
    participant J as Execution Journal
    participant T as Tool
    participant M as Meta Graph API
    participant O as Outcome Engine
    participant H as Historical Intel

    U->>A: "Execute this recommendation"
    A->>R: Generate recommendation
    R-->>A: Recommendation + paramsHash
    A->>AP: Request approval
    AP-->>U: "Approve this action?"
    U->>AP: Approve
    
    AP->>J: Begin execution (lease)
    J->>J: Record PENDING → APPROVED → EXECUTING
    
    J->>T: Execute with approved params
    T->>T: Verify paramsHash
    T->>M: POST write operation
    M-->>T: Success / Timeout / Error
    
    alt Success
        T-->>J: Mark SUCCEEDED
        J->>AP: Consume approval (atomic)
        AP-->>A: Execution complete
        A->>O: Schedule outcome measurement
    else Timeout
        T-->>J: Mark UNKNOWN
        J->>O: Schedule reconciliation
        O->>M: GET verify state
        M-->>O: State confirmed
        O-->>J: Finalize outcome
    else Error
        T-->>J: Mark FAILED
        J-->>A: Execution failed
    end
    
    O-->>O: Measure post-action metrics
    O-->>H: Store outcome
    H-->>H: Feed into historical evidence
    H-->>R: Inform future confidence
